PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE READ_ONLY

# PNCS v0.6 — first control-flow graph.
# Surface words IF / BELOW / THEN / GO are not PNV opcodes.
# No effect is silently executed; ACTION_REQUEST is an inspectable request node.

# Reused mathematical KAKU
OP K.DISTINGUISH DIFFERENCE left right
OP K.ORDER ORDER before after
OP K.COMPOSE COMPOSITION left relation right

# Control-flow KAKU candidates from recovered PNV/1 vocabulary
OP K.CONDITION CONDITION predicate relation reference
OP K.ACTION_REQUEST ACTION_REQUEST action target

# Surface relation BELOW: numeric delta followed by a strict-negative condition.
OP R.BELOW COMPOSITION K.DISTINGUISH K.CONDITION

# Conditional routing: predicate precedes action request and both form one program graph.
OP R.CONDITIONAL_ROUTE COMPOSITION K.CONDITION K.ORDER K.ACTION_REQUEST K.COMPOSE

# Canonical example for the surface sentence:
# IF gravity BELOW 0.5 THEN GO physics.gravity.low
OP EX.GRAVITY.DELTA DIFFERENCE gravity 0.5
OP EX.GRAVITY.BELOW CONDITION EX.GRAVITY.DELTA lt 0
OP EX.GRAVITY.GO ACTION_REQUEST route physics.gravity.low
OP EX.GRAVITY.ORDER ORDER EX.GRAVITY.BELOW EX.GRAVITY.GO
OP EX.GRAVITY.PROGRAM COMPOSITION EX.GRAVITY.BELOW EX.GRAVITY.ORDER EX.GRAVITY.GO

# 36D bindings are computational addresses, not semantic authority.
VECTOR V.R.BELOW "PNCS.radical.below" PRECISE
VECTOR V.R.CONDITIONAL_ROUTE "PNCS.radical.conditional_route" PRECISE
VECTOR V.EX.GRAVITY.PROGRAM "PNCS.example.if_gravity_below_0_5_go_physics_gravity_low" PRECISE

EMIT EX.GRAVITY.PROGRAM
